s8-2-p2 = prose (cons "Let \(L\) denote the specified C++ standard and its parameters, and \(B\) a build configuration. A C++ source term \(p\) is a constituent of the larger hyperactivity program in which it is used. Compiling it produces an executable representation \(\mathsf{build}_B(p)\) of that same programmed computation. Source behavior, emitted-machine behavior, and a dependent property \(P\) are different constructions **about the same program**, connected by checked compilation and execution evidence—not an independently written verification model and a separately deployed system." nil)
